WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
There's something wrong with this old jade

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:03,750
But it shouldn’t harm Nini.

3
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:05,070
I'm here

4
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:07,550
Keep the girl safe for a year

5
00:00:07,910 --> 00:00:10,790
A year later, you will come to Beiyu after escorting the traitor

6
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:11,990
I let you see her

7
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:13,150
Practice well

8
00:00:13,310 --> 00:00:14,230
Not sure next year

9
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:15,630
You can kill us all

10
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:17,430
Then no one can stop you anymore

11
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:26,280
Let them say goodbye to each other properly. I'm sorry, Nini.

12
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:29,840
I can't protect you but

13
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:32,510
After they can cure your disease

14
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:34,310
Nini doesn’t need to be in so much pain.

15
00:00:34,510 --> 00:00:37,080
Don't hurt her

16
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,120
I just believe her

17
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:39,320
One year very quickly

18
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:41,370
Stronger than them all

19
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:42,770
If I can’t see you then

20
00:00:42,930 --> 00:00:44,130
I'll kill them all

21
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:46,090
If they bully you

22
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:47,370
Just endure it for now

23
00:00:47,370 --> 00:00:48,660
Write it down secretly

24
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:49,980
Tell me when we meet

25
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:54,500
I will kill anyone who bullies you, Brother Gu

26
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:56,620
There is also a can of tobacco radish in the house

27
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:57,940
You remember to put it on

28
00:00:58,380 --> 00:00:59,380
Come to Beiyu later

29
00:00:59,380 --> 00:01:06,370
I'll make it for you again

30
00:01:06,770 --> 00:01:08,210
This is not a separation between life and death.
